<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar experts defer talks on stocks, coefficient.</title>
<headline>EU sugar experts defer talks on stocks, coefficient.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union sugar experts on Wednesday deferred discussion on minimum stocks penalties and the coefficients used to calculate the amount of sugar in processed products which are exported, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There was no time for the discussions to take place at Wednesday's meeting and the European Commission has indicated that they will be listed on next week's agenda,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
